– Continual-learning algorithms:
    --method {sgd (FT), er, ewc, agem, ssgd}  (sgd = finetune / baseline)
    Additional hyper-parameters:
        --mem-size <int>          (buffer per class for ER / AGEM, default 1)
        --lambd                  (EWC regularization λ, default 1)

– Optimisation:
    SAM activated with --sam  (ρ controlled by --rho, default 0.05)
    Base LR --lr (default 0.01), momentum --momentum, decay --gamma.

– Training schedule:
    --epochs-per-task (default 5) ; batch-size --batch-size (default 10).

– Seeds / runs:
    --seed, --runs for repeatability.

– Outputs:
    metrics and checkpoints saved to --output-folder, loss-landscape JSON via analysis/run_analysis_vision.py, and figures via analysis/visualization.py.
